WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.068 --> 00:00:05.039 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:00:02.436 --> 00:00:06.407 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Dès les premières secondes,

00:00:03.771 --> 00:00:07.775 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la tension est palpable.

00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:12.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Jean Charest et Pierre Poilievre

00:00:06.507 --> 00:00:12.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont les deux seuls candidats

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:12.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à ne pas se serrer la main.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.387 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Comme à son habitude,

00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:21.755 size:53% position:73% line:53%
celui qui est soenent

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:23.090 size:53% position:73% line:53%
décrit comme le meneur

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:27.227 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans la course reproche

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:28.562 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'ancien premier ministre

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:29.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du Québec d'être un libéral.

00:00:27.328 --> 00:00:31.265 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et de mal comprendre la cause

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:32.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des camionneurs à Ottawa,

00:00:29.997 --> 00:00:33.968 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qua a a soutenue.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:35.336 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:37.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Quand Jean Charest réplique et

00:00:34.068 --> 00:00:37.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
accuse Pierre Poilievre d'avoir

00:00:35.436 --> 00:00:37.304 size:53% position:73% line:53%
appuyé des blocages illégaux...

00:00:40.274 --> 00:00:49.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... nombreux dans la foule

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:50.851 size:53% position:73% line:53%
huent le candidat québécoi

00:00:46.847 --> 00:00:52.219 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(huées)

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:53.587 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... et signalent clairement

00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:54.922 size:53% position:73% line:53%
où ils se rangent quand

00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:56.290 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il est question du convoi.

00:00:53.687 --> 00:01:00.895 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le député de la régioOtOtOttawa

00:00:55.022 --> 00:01:02.229 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maintient la pression sur

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:03.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son principal adversaire...

00:01:00.995 --> 00:01:04.932 size:53% position:73% line:53%
... lui demande, avec

00:01:02.329 --> 00:01:06.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
insistance, combien d'argent

00:01:03.697 --> 00:01:09.536 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a reçu de la compagnie

00:01:05.032 --> 00:01:10.871 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Huawei, à l'époque de

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:12.239 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la détention des deux Michael.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:13.574 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Jean Charest ne répond pas

00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:14.909 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et tente plutôt de mettre Pierre

00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:20.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Poilievre sur la sellette et

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:20.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lui reproche de dire une chose

00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:20.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et son contraire sur la loi 21.

00:01:34.261 --> 00:01:38.232 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 La candidate de la droite

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:39.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sociale, Leslyn Lewis, accus

00:01:36.964 --> 00:01:45.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
elle aussi, Pierre Poilievre

00:01:38.332 --> 00:01:45.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de tergiverser, cette fois-ci

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:45.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur la question de l'avortement.

00:01:45.506 --> 00:01:50.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Car, plus tôt cette semaine,

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:52.179 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en pleine tempête aux États-Unis

00:01:49.543 --> 00:01:53.514 size:53% position:73% line:53%
heures avant de préciser

00:01:50.911 --> 00:01:54.848 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'il n'allait pas rouvrir

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:56.216 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le débat sur la question.

00:01:53.614 --> 00:01:57.584 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Let's give a round of ap

00:01:54.949 --> 00:01:58.919 size:53% position:73% line:53%
to all of our leadership

00:01:56.317 --> 00:02:00.287 size:53% position:73% line:53%
candidates.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:01.655 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:01:59.019 --> 00:02:02.990 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Après une heure et demie

00:02:00.387 --> 00:02:04.325 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'échanges acrimonieux, chaque

00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:05.592 size:53% position:73% line:53%
candidat repart de son côté.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:06.894 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Encore une fois, aucune poignée

00:02:04.425 --> 00:02:08.195 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de main entre les deux présumés

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:09.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
meneurs. Le fossé qui rerererere

00:02:06.994 --> 00:02:09.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne pourrait être plus évident.

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:09.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Laurence Martin,

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:09.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Canada, Ottaw

